Description:
Helpers from AOSP to read process information from /proc. libunwindstack
uses include/procinfo/process_map.h, which //third_party/libunwindstack
builds into its libunwindstack target.

src/ holds that file from the upstream repository root, unchanged.

To update, copy include/procinfo/process_map.h at the new revision into
src/include/procinfo/ and update Revision above.
